  ],
  "facts": {
    "bid": "Spain+Portugal bid, Morocco joined (2023); Uruguay/Argentina/Paraguay(+Chile) centenary bid; FIFA Council 4 Oct 2023: single joint bid, one opening match each in UY/AR/PY; 104 matches, 101 in ES/PT/MA",
    "1930": "13 teams (7 South America, 4 Europe, 2 North America); France, Belgium, Romania on the Conte Verde (with Rimet); Yugoslavia on the Florida; Centenario built for the centenary of Uruguay's first constitution (1830), rain delayed it, first game there five days in; final 30 July 1930 Uruguay 4-2 Argentina at the Centenario",
    "2030": "Centenario to host Uruguay's 2030 opening match"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "The 2030 World Cup will be played on three continents. Here's how that happened.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "hook": true,
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "wc_trophy_globe",
            "big": "3 CONTINENTS",
            "bigSize": 170,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "HOW?",
            "size": 360,
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It began as a European bid: Spain and Portugal. Then Morocco joined them.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "x7_flags",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "ES",
                "label": "SPAIN"
              }
            ],
            "title": "THE BID",
            "cols": 1,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "ES",
                "label": "SPAIN",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "PT",
                "label": "PORTUGAL"
              }
            ],
            "title": "THE BID",
            "w": 8
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "ES",
                "label": "SPAIN",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "PT",
                "label": "PORTUGAL",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "MA",
                "label": "MOROCCO"
              }
            ],
            "title": "THE BID",
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, South America wanted the 2030 tournament too, for a very good reason.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "orange",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "south_america_fans",
            "label": "SOUTH AMERICA",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "WHY 2030?",
            "size": 260,
            "w": 12
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The very first World Cup was in Uruguay, in 1930.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "1930",
                "top": "JULY",
                "label": "Uruguay",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#0038a8"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario",
            "label": "URUGUAY 1930",
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Only thirteen teams entered. Just four came from Europe.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "tally",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "tally",
            "n": 13,
            "cols": 4,
            "title": "13 TEAMS",
            "dy": 40,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "FR",
                "label": "FRANCE"
              },
              {
                "code": "BE",
                "label": "BELGIUM"
              },
              {
                "code": "RO",
                "label": "ROMANIA"
              },
              {
                "code": "YU",
                "label": "YUGOSLAVIA"
              }
            ],
            "title": "FROM EUROPE: 4",
            "gap": 0.2,
            "w": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Three of them crossed the Atlantic on the same ship, the Conte Verde.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "conte_verde",
            "label": "THE CONTE VERDE",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "route",
            "cities": [
              "EUROPE",
              "MONTEVIDEO"
            ],
            "parcel": true,
            "w": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uruguay built a huge new stadium, the Centenario, for a hundred years since its first constitution.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario",
            "big": "CENTENARIO",
            "bigSize": 170,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 100,
            "fmt": "{v}",
            "word": "YEARS: 1830 → 1930",
            "size": 380,
            "w": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But rain delayed the building, and it wasn't ready for the first games.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario_rain",
            "label": "NOT READY",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "NOT|READY",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 240,
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Five days in, it opened. And in the final, Uruguay beat Argentina four-two, right there.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario",
            "label": "OPEN",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "score",
            "top": "30 JULY 1930 · FINAL",
            "home": "URUGUAY",
            "homeCol": "#5eb6e4",
            "homeInk": "#1b1416",
            "away": "ARGENTINA",
            "awayCol": "#ffffff",
            "score": "4-2",
            "foot": "ESTADIO CENTENARIO",
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So for the hundredth birthday, South America gets three games: in Uruguay, Argentina and Paraguay.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "orange",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "100TH|BIRTHDAY",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 220,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "UY",
                "label": "URUGUAY"
              }
            ],
            "cols": 1,
            "title": "3 OPENING GAMES",
            "w": 11
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "UY",
                "label": "URUGUAY",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "AR",
                "label": "ARGENTINA"
              }
            ],
            "title": "3 OPENING GAMES",
            "w": 12
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "UY",
                "label": "URUGUAY",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "AR",
                "label": "ARGENTINA",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "PY",
                "label": "PARAGUAY"
              }
            ],
            "title": "3 OPENING GAMES",
            "w": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "FIFA agreed in 2023: one joint bid, six hosts. The other hundred and one games go to Spain, Portugal and Morocco.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "years",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "years",
            "items": [
              {
                "year": "2023",
                "top": "OCTOBER",
                "label": "FIFA agrees",
                "tick": true,
                "head": "#1ea85a"
              }
            ],
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_flags",
            "items": [
              {
                "code": "ES",
                "label": "SPAIN",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "PT",
                "label": "PORTUGAL",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "MA",
                "label": "MOROCCO",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "UY",
                "label": "URUGUAY",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "AR",
                "label": "ARGENTINA",
                "old": true
              },
              {
                "code": "PY",
                "label": "PARAGUAY",
                "old": true
              }
            ],
            "title": "6 HOSTS",
            "w": 7
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 101,
            "fmt": "{v}",
            "word": "OF 104 GAMES IN SPAIN, PORTUGAL, MOROCCO",
            "size": 380,
            "w": 11
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So a hundred years on, the Centenario hosts a World Cup again.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario",
            "big": "1930 → 2030",
            "bigSize": 150,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "centenario_2030",
            "label": "2030",
            "w": 6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Six countries. Three continents. One World Cup.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "6 COUNTRIES",
            "size": 200,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "6 COUNTRIES|3 CONTINENTS",
            "size": 200,
            "w": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "6 COUNTRIES|3 CONTINENTS|1 WORLD CUP",
            "hi": 2,
            "size": 190,
            "w": 4
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
